{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統當勞·特朗普將於本周末舉辦一場晚宴，允許其個人迷因幣的最大持有者與總統接觸。與此同時，民主黨誓言調查特朗普政府涉嫌存在的「大規模腐敗」問題，而該代幣價格已跌至歷史低點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587254.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.305247+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_hash":"844e1c16a0792baeb9225f6f1c0bf02601230e7df5c1ff06899c400c80ec3053","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}